Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

FFTW ESTIMATE plans are one transform wide, and FFTW threads are 1.
plan_many with a batch size equal to the local plane count can choose
a different codelet when the rank count changes that count.
The measured binaries use the internal Temperton FFT, not this path.
Temperton's lot size is ncache/(4*n), which does not depend on rank.

